OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEarly release scheme could see
OL,4,Adangerous criminals released,
OL,5,AConservatives warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister said at the weekend
OL,8,Fanyone convicted of manslaughter would
OL,9,Fbe excluded from the early prisoner
OL,10,Frelease scheme, following a campaign
OL,11,Ffrom PC Andrew Harper's family to block
OL,12,Fthe release of two men convicted over
OL,13,Fhis killing in 2019.
OL,15,FHe said prison space would be found by
OL,16,Freleasing some inmates serving
OL,17,Findefinite sentences, known as IPPs as
OL,18,Fwell as by deporting foreign prisoners.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
