OL,3,AJewish community in harder position
OL,4,Athan immediately after synagogue
OL,5,Aattack, says rabbi
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I think we're actually almost in a
OL,8,Fharder position than we were even
OL,9,Fimmediately after the attack," he said
OL,10,Fahead of a memorial service for the
OL,11,Fvictims and survivors which will take
OL,12,Fplace later today.
OL,14,F"I think the sense of vulnerability has
OL,15,Fgrown. It hasn't diminished."
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
