OL,3,AUS and Iran trade strikes for first
OL,4,Atime in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran and the US have traded strikes
OL,7,Fafter American forces attacked two
OL,8,Frocket launchers on Larak Island in the
OL,9,FStrait of Hormuz.
OL,11,FThe first known US strikes on Iran
OL,12,Fsince late July killed two people and
OL,13,Finjured two others, according to Iran's
OL,14,FIslamic Revolutionary Guard Corps
OL,15,F(IRGC), which vowed "response and
OL,16,Fpunishment".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
